<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL 55-1 AT LUNCH VS W.PROVINCE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL 55-1 AT LUNCH VS W.PROVINCE.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal were 55 for one from 24 overs at lunch needing 297 from a minimum of 97 overs for victory over Western Province on the final day of their Supersport Series match at Newlands on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Western Province 433-3 declared and 222, Natal 359 and 55-1 (Andrew Hudson 35 not out).</p>
